# Remotion deps + generated artifacts — keep source (scripts, components), ignore output.
remotion/node_modules/
remotion/out/
remotion/.remotion/
# Captured screens + manifest are generated by `npm run promo:capture`. Regenerable;
# do not commit (they're large binaries that churn on every UI change).
remotion/public/captures/
# Playwright capture scratch output
.pw-output/
# Drop-in music is local (licensing); commit only a note, not the audio.
remotion/public/music/*
!remotion/public/music/README.md
